//! The `interactivity` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! whether an element and its descendant nodes are set to be
//! [inert](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Global_attributes/inert).
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | inert
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-interactivity
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/interactivity
